{"text": "One morning the busy doctor called Sue into the hall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She has one chance in ten, he said, and that chance is for her to want to live. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She has made up her mind that she is not going to get well. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After the doctor left, Sue went into Johnsys room with her drawing board, whistling a cheerful tune. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Johnsy was lying with her eyes wide open, counting backward. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Twelve, she said, and a little later, eleven, and then ten and nine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sue looked out of the window and saw only an old ivy vine climbing up the brick wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Leaves on the ivy, Johnsy whispered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the last one falls, I must go too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have known that for three days. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Oh, I never heard of such nonsense, said Sue, but Johnsy only closed her eyes.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "u", "s", "y", " ", "d", "o", "c", "t", "o", "r", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "S", "u", "e", " ", "i", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "s", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "c", "h", "a", "n", "c", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "e", "n", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "c", "h", "a", "n", "c", "e", " ", "i", "s", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "t", "o", " ", "w", "a", "n", "t", " ", "t", "o", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "s", " ", "m", "a", "d", "e", " ", "u", "p", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "m", "i", "n", "d", " ",